  "description": "AI 写完代码，先看懂改了什么、有没有问题：变更说明、带证据的代码评审、发回修改与审查留档。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "code-review",
    "evidentloop"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "npm run typecheck && node plugin/scripts/build.mjs && node docs/build.mjs",
    "test": "node --import tsx plugin/tests/run.mjs && node core/tests/all.mjs",
    "typecheck": "node plugin/scripts/schema-types.mjs --check && tsc --noEmit",
    "test:ui": "node --import tsx plugin/tests/browser-headless.mjs"
  },
  "files": [
    "plugin/dist",
    "plugin/skills",
    "plugin/vendor",
    "plugin/package.json",
    "plugin/cordis.patch.yml",
    "plugin/LICENSE",
    "plugin/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md",
    "plugin/README.md",
    "core/index.mjs",
    "core/prepare.mjs",
    "core/validate.mjs",
    "core/lib",
    "core/package.json",
    "core/LICENSE",
    "core/README.md",
    "skills",
    "docs/guide.md",
    "docs/build.mjs",
    "docs/icon.svg",
    "docs/site-src",
    "docs/site",
    "prototype/index.html",
    "prototype/src",
    "prototype/styles",
    "prototype/assets",
    "prototype/data",
    "prototype/vendor",
    "prototype/README.md",
    "LICENSE",
